    "html": "<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <title>Home | Matricula Online</title>\n    \n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no\">\n    <meta id=\"meta_title\" property=\"og:title\" content=\"\"> \n    <meta id=\"meta_desc\" property=\"og:description\" content=\"\"> \n    <meta id=\"meta_image\" property=\"og:image\" content=\"\">\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"\">\n    <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"\">\n    <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#2eb5e8\">\n    <meta name=\"msapplication-navbutton-color\" content=\"#2eb5e8\">\n    <meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\" content=\"#2eb5e8\">\n\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn-static.matricula-online.eu/static/css/styles.71486ff71a6d.css\">\n    <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"https://cdn-static.matricula-online.eu/static/favicon.2e03c06c34c1.ico\">\n    \n    \n\n\n<!-- Google tag (gtag.js) -->\n<script async=\"\" src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-PEGND6X2JS\"></script>\n<script>\n  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n  gtag('js', new Date());\n\n  gtag('config', 'G-PEGND6X2JS');\n</script>\n\n\n</head>\n<body class=\"\">\n\n<div id=\"container\" class=\"wrap\">\n    <noscript>\n        <div class=\"alert alert-danger text-center\">\n                <strong>\n                        For full functionality of this site (searching, viewing images, maps and pdf files) it is necessary to enable JavaScript. Here are the <a class=\"alert-link\" href=\"http://www.enable-javascript.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> instructions how to enable JavaScript in your web browser</a>.\n                </strong>\n        </div>\n    </noscript>\n    \n    <div class=\"navbar navbar-expand-md navbar-light bg-light\" role=\"navigation\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            \n\t<a class=\"navbar-brand\" href=\"/en/\">\n        <img class=\"d-inline d-md-none\" src=\"https://cdn-static.matricula-online.eu/static/img/matricula-icon-small.f6ee1a3cba9e.png\" alt=\"Matricula\">\n        <span class=\"d-none d-md-inline text-primary\">Matricula Online</span>\n        \n    </a>\n\n\n            <button class=\"navbar-toggler\" type=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#navbar-collapsed\" aria-controls=\"navbarSupportedContent\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\">\n                <span class=\"navbar-toggler-icon\"></span>\n            </button>\n\n            \n            <div class=\"navbar-collapse collapse\" id=\"navbar-collapsed\">\n                \n                <ul class=\"navbar-nav mr-auto\">\n                    \n    <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/en/bestande/\">Fonds</a></li>\n    <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/en/landkarte/\">Map</a></li>\n    <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/en/suchen/\">Search for Places</a></li>\n\n                </ul>\n                \n\n                <ul class=\"navbar-nav ml-auto\">\n                    \n    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary mr-2\" href=\"https://icar-us.eu/en/cooperation/online-portals/matricula/support/\" target=\"_blank\">Support Matricula</a>\n    </li>\n    \n        \n        \n    \n\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"page-main-content\" class=\"container mt-4\">\n        \n            \n        \n\n        \n            \n            \n\n            \n            \n            \n\n            \n<div class=\"header\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-8\">\n\n\t<div>\n<h2>Welcome to Matricula!</h2>\n<p>Here you can find church registers (mostly books of birth, marriage, and death) from various European countries (currently Austria, Germany, Italy, Luxembourg, Poland, Serbia, and Slovenia).</p>\n<p>We are aiming at expanding the content of this website continuously, but we also have to take care of the respective national legislations (<a href=\"https://www.ris.bka.gv.at/GeltendeFassung.wxe?Abfrage=Bundesnormen&amp;Gesetzesnummer=20008228\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">personal status act</a>, data protection act).</p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<div id=\"browse\" class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a class=\"matricula-link btn btn-default btn-lg btn-block p-5\" title=\"resources\" href=\"/bestande/\"> <span class=\"text-primary glyphicon glyphicon-book fa fa-book\" style=\"font-size: 60px;\">&nbsp;</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a class=\"matricula-link btn btn-default btn-lg btn-block p-5\" title=\"map\" href=\"/landkarte/\"> <span class=\"text-primary glyphicon glyphicon-book fa fa-map-marked-alt\" style=\"font-size: 60px;\">&nbsp;</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a class=\"matricula-link btn btn-default btn-lg btn-block p-5\" title=\"location search\" href=\"/suchen/\"> <span class=\"text-primary glyphicon glyphicon-book fa fa-search\" style=\"font-size: 60px;\">&nbsp;</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h3 class=\"text-center\">Let´s publish more with your help: :</h3>\n<form style=\"text-align: center;\" action=\"https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr\" method=\"post\" target=\"_top\"><input name=\"cmd\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"_s-xclick\"><input name=\"hosted_button_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"HCSDCSHX7Q4YW\"><input title=\"PayPal - The safer, easier way to pay online!\" alt=\"Donate with PayPal button\" name=\"submit\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/AT/i/btn/btn_donateCC_LG.gif\" type=\"image\"><img src=\"https://www.paypal.com/en_AT/i/scr/pixel.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" border=\"0\"></form>\n<p></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 class=\"text-center\">Or become part of our community</h3>\n<p class=\"clearfix\"><img class=\"pull-left float-left\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 60px;\" src=\"https://cdn-static.matricula-online.eu/static/img/logo-icarus-4-all.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\"> <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg pull-right float-right\" href=\"https://icar-us.eu/cooperation/online-portals/matricula/etwas-in-eigener-sache/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Further information</a></p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"text-center services\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 col-xs-12\">\n<p>Visit also:</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 col-xs-12\"><a href=\"http://icar-us.eu/cooperation/online-portals/monasterium-net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn-static.matricula-online.eu/static/img/logo-monasterium.png\"></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 col-xs-12\"><a href=\"http://topothek.at/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn-static.matricula-online.eu/static/img/logo-topothek.png\"></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div id=\"news\" class=\"col-lg-4\">\n\t<p></p>\n\t\n\t\n\t<div class=\"card mb-3\">\n\t\t<div class=\"card-header\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"/en/nachrichten/bistum_regensburg_baende_ergaenzt_20260922-2/\">Bistum Regensburg: Bände und Schutzfristen angepasst</a><br>\n            <small>Sept. 22, 2026</small>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card-body\">\n\t\t\t<p>Folgende Bände wurden zugänglich gemacht bzw. deren Schutzfristen angepasst:</p>\n<p>Moosbach (Niederbayern) 15&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Kirchberg / Vilsbiburg …</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"card mb-3\">\n\t\t<div class=\"card-header\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"/en/nachrichten/bistum_regensburg_baende_ergaenzt_20260922/\">Bistum Regensburg: Bände ergänzt</a><br>\n            <small>Sept. 22, 2026</small>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"card-body\">\n\t\t\t<p>Neu verfügbar sind folgende Matrikel:</p>\n<p>Ast021 Ast022 Ast023 Ast024</p>\n<p>Ast025, Ast027</p>\n<p>Bach009, Bach010</p>\n<p>Deggendorf037, Deggendorf038, …</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"card mb-3\">\n\t\t<div class=\"card-header\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"/en/nachrichten/rottenburg-stuttgart-weitere-kirchenbuecher-31/\"